{"release":{"id":385777010,"tag":"yue2-v0.1.6","author":"a43992899","name":"YuE2 · frontier music generation with symbolic planning","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T19:07:51Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-09T19:10:05Z","markdown":"YuE2 brings frontier song quality and editable symbolic plans to the YuE repository. Create songs from lyrics, make zero-shot covers from a transcribed melody, and work with an agent to revise a composition.\n\n- Install the Python wheel below, or clone the repository and run `pip install .` with Python 3.12.\n- Download `yue2-music.zip` to install the portable agent skill.\n- Download `yue2_infer-0.1.6.tar.gz` for the source distribution. `SHA256SUMS` covers all three artifacts.\n- Model weights are available under [m-a-p on Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/m-a-p/YuE2-3B).\n- Hear songs, covers and the editing process on the [demo page](https://map-yue2.github.io/).\n- The original model, code and documentation remain on [YuE-v1](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/tree/YuE-v1).\n\nFirst-party YuE2 code, skill and weights: **CC BY-NC 4.0**. Third-party components and the YuE-v1 archive retain their original licenses.\n\nValidated with 172 passing installed-wheel tests, 11 skipped, and fresh GPU generation/cover/editing runs. A fixed generation matches public 0.1.5 exactly; this patch updates public packaging, licensing and CLI availability. Default listening uses YuE2-Vae; the recorded benchmarks use YuE2-Vae-legacy.\n","html":"<p>YuE2 brings frontier song quality and editable symbolic plans to the YuE repository. Create songs from lyrics, make zero-shot covers from a transcribed melody, and work with an agent to revise a composition.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install the Python wheel below, or clone the repository and run <code>pip install .</code> with Python 3.12.</li>\n<li>Download <code>yue2-music.zip</code> to install the portable agent skill.</li>\n<li>Download <code>yue2_infer-0.1.6.tar.gz</code> for the source distribution. <code>SHA256SUMS</code> covers all three artifacts.</li>\n<li>Model weights are available under <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/m-a-p/YuE2-3B\" rel=\"nofollow\">m-a-p on Hugging Face</a>.</li>\n<li>Hear songs, covers and the editing process on the <a href=\"https://map-yue2.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\">demo page</a>.</li>\n<li>The original model, code and documentation remain on <a href=\"https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/tree/YuE-v1\">YuE-v1</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>First-party YuE2 code, skill and weights: <strong>CC BY-NC 4.0</strong>. Third-party components and the YuE-v1 archive retain their original licenses.</p>\n<p>Validated with 172 passing installed-wheel tests, 11 skipped, and fresh GPU generation/cover/editing runs. A fixed generation matches public 0.1.5 exactly; this patch updates public packaging, licensing and CLI availability. Default listening uses YuE2-Vae; the recorded benchmarks use YuE2-Vae-legacy.</p>\n","assets":[{"contentType":"application/octet-stream","size":271,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","downloadCount":341,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/releases/download/yue2-v0.1.6/SHA256SUMS"},{"contentType":"application/zip","size":54685,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","downloadCount":1655,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/releases/download/yue2-v0.1.6/yue2-music.zip"},{"contentType":"application/octet-stream","size":77582,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","downloadCount":1312,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/releases/download/yue2-v0.1.6/yue2_infer-0.1.6-py3-none-any.whl"},{"contentType":"application/x-gtar","size":700290,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:42Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T19:08:43Z","downloadCount":302,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/releases/download/yue2-v0.1.6/yue2_infer-0.1.6.tar.gz"}]}}